{"text":"Thirdly, people in the emerging markets look at China's amazing and legendary infrastructure rollout. It's not just about China building roads and ports and railways in her own country. She's been able to build 85,000 kilometers of road network in China and surpass that of the United States. But even if you look to places like Africa, China has been able to help tar the distance of Cape Town to Cairo, which is 9,000 miles or three times the distance of New York to California. Now, this is something that people can see and point to. Perhaps it's no surprise that in a 2007 Pew survey, when surveyed, Africans in 10 countries said they thought that the Chinese were doing amazing things to improve their livelihoods by wide margins by as much as 98 percent.","words":[{"text":"Thirdly","start":1.22,"end":1.84,"punct":","},{"text":"people","start":2.4,"end":2.6},{"text":"in","start":2.6,"end":2.8},{"text":"the","start":2.8,"end":2.88},{"text":"emerging","start":2.88,"end":3.16},{"text":"markets","start":3.16,"end":3.62},{"text":"look","start":3.62,"end":3.98},{"text":"at","start":3.98,"end":4.18},{"text":"China's","start":4.18,"end":4.68},{"text":"amazing","start":4.68,"end":5.22},{"text":"and","start":5.22,"end":5.5},{"text":"legendary","start":5.5,"end":6.14},{"text":"infrastructure","start":6.14,"end":6.84},{"text":"rollout","start":6.84,"end":7.48,"punct":"."},{"text":"It's","start":8.12,"end":8.58},{"text":"not","start":8.58,"end":8.76},{"text":"just","start":8.76,"end":9.0},{"text":"about","start":9.0,"end":9.3},{"text":"China","start":9.3,"end":9.8},{"text":"building","start":9.8,"end":10.28},{"text":"roads","start":10.28,"end":10.82},{"text":"and","start":10.82,"end":11.38},{"text":"ports","start":11.38,"end":11.76},{"text":"and","start":11.76,"end":12.06},{"text":"railways","start":12.06,"end":12.38},{"text":"in","start":12.38,"end":12.62},{"text":"her","start":12.62,"end":12.8},{"text":"own","start":12.8,"end":13.04},{"text":"country","start":13.04,"end":